              </header>

              <footer class="card-footer-actions">
                <a href="/attendances/export/excel" class="btn">Download Excel</a>
              </footer>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="card flow-card">
            <header>
              <h2>Alur Testing dari Dashboard</h2>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">
                Semua fitur dites dari sidebar atau card pada halaman ini.
              </p>
            </header>

            <section class="flow-list">
              <div class="flow-item">
                <span class="flow-number bg-primary text-primary-foreground">1</span>
                <span>
                  Klik <strong>Kirim Reminder</strong>, pilih event, pilih
                  channel, isi pesan, lalu kirim reminder.
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="flow-item">
                <span class="flow-number bg-primary text-primary-foreground">2</span>
                <span>
                  Klik <strong>Riwayat Reminder</strong> untuk memastikan reminder
                  yang dikirim sudah tersimpan.
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="flow-item">
                <span class="flow-number bg-primary text-primary-foreground">3</span>
                <span>
                  Klik <strong>Check-in Peserta</strong>, lalu masukkan ticket
                  number peserta, misalnya <strong>TICKET-AKRAM-001</strong>.
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="flow-item">
                <span class="flow-number bg-primary text-primary-foreground">4</span>
                <span>
                  Klik <strong>Attendance List</strong> untuk memastikan peserta
